From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julien Etienne <julien.etienne@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 11:32:30 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 614/614] arm64: dts: mediatek: gemini-station: allow UHS
 SDR104 on the microSD slot

At SDR50 the slot reads at about 43 MiB/s from a 192 MHz source divided
by two. The vendor runs the slot at SDR104 from its 200 MHz clock
source. Move the MSDC30_1 mux to msdcpll_d2 and allow SDR104 at up to
200 MHz; mtk-sd tunes it with the MT6797 data it already has. Only the
microSD mux is reparented; msdcpll's rate and the eMMC's mux are left
as they are.

DDR50 stays out, as in the vendor's board description. Add disable-wp:
a microSD slot has no write-protect switch, and without it the core
logs that it is assuming write-enable on every insert.

Not yet run on hardware.
---
 .../dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda-station.dts   | 16 +++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda-station.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda-station.dts
index 1a041cf..fbd0cb8 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda-station.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/mt6797-gemini-pda-station.dts
@@ -643,21 +643,27 @@
 };
 
 /*
- * Up to UHS SDR50, 4 bits: 1.8 V signalling and at most 100 MHz, which the
- * 192 MHz source gives as 96 MHz. No SDR104 or DDR50. The pads use the
- * vendor's settings for each signalling voltage. The vendor reads the
- * card-detect pin high as a card present.
+ * Up to UHS SDR104, 4 bits: 1.8 V signalling and at most 200 MHz. The
+ * source moves to msdcpll_d2, as the vendor's 200 MHz clock source; the
+ * eMMC's mux is untouched. No DDR50, which the vendor leaves out too. The
+ * pads use the vendor's settings for each signalling voltage. The vendor
+ * reads the card-detect pin high as a card present. A microSD card has no
+ * write-protect switch.
  */
 &mmc1 {
+	assigned-clocks = <&topckgen CLK_TOP_MUX_MSDC30_1>;
+	assigned-clock-parents = <&topckgen CLK_TOP_MSDCPLL_D2>;
 	pinctrl-names = "default", "state_uhs";
 	pinctrl-0 = <&mmc1_pins_default>;
 	pinctrl-1 = <&mmc1_pins_uhs>;
 	bus-width = <4>;
-	max-frequency = <100000000>;
+	max-frequency = <200000000>;
 	cap-sd-highspeed;
 	sd-uhs-sdr12;
 	sd-uhs-sdr25;
 	sd-uhs-sdr50;
+	sd-uhs-sdr104;
+	disable-wp;
 	cd-gpios = <&pio 67 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
 	vmmc-supply = <&mt6351_vmch_reg>;
 	vqmmc-supply = <&mt6351_vmc_reg>;
